#. <CLT 4>水槽だ…
#. 小さな魚が泳いでいる…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a fish tank. There's a bunch of little fish\n"
"swimming around inside...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>どう見ても…事件とは関係ないよな。
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>I can't imagine how this could have anything to do\n"
"with the case...\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 4>水槽だ…小さな魚が泳いでいる…
#. どういう意味だよ…
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0003 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"<CLT 4>It's a fish tank. There's a little fish swimming\n"
"around inside... What does it mean...?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""

#. はい
msgctxt "0004 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ
msgctxt "0005 | CHOICE/RE:ACT"
msgid "No"
msgstr ""

#. <CLT 23>外に出ますか？
#. <CLT>
msgctxt "0006 | NARRATION"
msgid ""
"<CLT 23>Leave the area?\n"
"<CLT>"
msgstr ""
